\pard\plain \ltrch\loch {\f0\fs24\b0 The objective of the \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93Technology Migration Engine\u8221\'94 project was to develop software capabel of transforming Perl Catalyst MVC controllers into Java Spring MVC controllers. The system aims to be innovative, being grounded in a transpilation-LLM hybrid: Syntax that requires flexibility is handled using LLMs, whereas repetitive structural syntax is handled through traditional transpilation methods. The result is a software that strikes the perfect balance between implementation complexity and quality of output. Overall, the project demonstrates that integrating LLMs within a controlled framework allows their generative benefits to be realised without the risk of hallucination.\line }}